      "after": {
        "zh": "第一次的输出作为第二次的输入，同一像素最终累加了两组权重的所有乘积。边界规则由处理器传给两次取样。",
        "en": "Feeding the first result into the second accumulates all products of the two sets of weights. The processor passes the selected border policy to both reads."
      }
